### main

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl main () : i32 =\n    inl frames = 60i32\n    inl size = width () * height ()\n    inl depth : a i32 f64 = am.init size (fun _ => 0f64)\n    inl chars : a i32 i32 = am.init size (fun _ => background ())\n    inl rot = mut (rotation { a = 0f64; b = 0f64; c = 0f64 })\n    inl checksum = mut 0i32\n    loopw.for' {from=0i32; nearTo=frames} fun _ =>\n        checksum <- render depth chars *rot *checksum\n        rot <- next_rotation *rot\n    inl checksum = *checksum\n    !!!!Printf(\"cube: %d frames, checksum %d\\n\", frames, checksum)\n    0i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl main () : i32 =
      inl frames = 60i32
      inl size = width () * height ()
      inl depth : a i32 f64 = am.init size (fun _ => 0f64)
      inl chars : a i32 i32 = am.init size (fun _ => background ())
      inl rot = mut (rotation { a = 0f64; b = 0f64; c = 0f64 })
      inl checksum = mut 0i32
      loopw.for' {from=0i32; nearTo=frames} fun _ =>
          checksum <- render depth chars *rot *checksum
          rot <- next_rotation *rot
      inl checksum = *checksum
      !!!!Printf("cube: %d frames, checksum %d\n", frames, checksum)
      0i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
